      "id": "claim_0b78b84073a44ca295c8f046a7a3e465",
      "statement": "The openwiki-update workflow refreshes the wiki on a nightly 07:17 UTC schedule (cron 17 7 * * *), on release tags, and on manual dispatch; scheduled runs exit early when nothing outside openwiki/, AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md has changed since the last wiki update, then it runs openwiki --init or --update with the model pinned to DeepInfra only, injects .github/openwiki-retry.mjs via NODE_OPTIONS --import to retry 429 responses with backoff, opens a pull request limited to openwiki, AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md, and auto-merges it.",
